Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 14:41:01 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Replace stale updater workers before manual daemon updates

Manual updates compare the running updater's executable identity with the
requesting CLI before connecting to its socket. Unknown legacy identities
and different executables launch the requesting CLI's updater. Matching
workers remain running. Publish updater launch identities and preserve the
complete ownership record during Windows successor handoff.

Fixes holdmyspot-com/codex-unleashed#54.

TDD: maintained just test, package codex-app-server-daemon, handoff filter:
red exit 100, old updater returned upstream instead of unleashed; matching
control passed. Patched package suite: 71 passed, one fixture skipped.
Execution records: .cat/work/temp/daemon-updater-handoff-m1Fw4L.
